@host = http://localhost:5258

### Create a profile (PasswordHash carries the plain password; the API hashes it)
POST {{host}}/profile/create
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Name": "Alice", "Email": "alice@example.com", "PasswordHash": "secret" }

### Log in -> response body is the token; paste it into @token
POST {{host}}/profile/login/alice@example.com
Content-Type: application/json

"secret"

###
@token = paste-token-here
@battleId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Register a battle (caller becomes owner and first player) -> copy "id" into @battleId
PUT {{host}}/battle/register?name=test1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Other players join / leave (owner leaving disbands the battle)
PUT {{host}}/battle/join?id={{battleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{host}}/battle/leave?id={{battleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Every player marks ready
PUT {{host}}/battle/playerready?id={{battleId}}&isReady=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Owner starts: launches the game server, returns { id, host, port, ticket }
PUT {{host}}/battle/start?id={{battleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Other players: where to connect + their own one-time ticket (409 until started)
GET {{host}}/battle/endpoint?id={{battleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Running game server processes and their ports
GET {{host}}/battle/instances

### Owner aborts: removes the battle and stops its game server
PUT {{host}}/battle/finish?id={{battleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
